              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo yilangwa tiyicigonaga kweleko kwisa soni yinyama yamwitinji. Yisyamtima tiyicitamaga m'masame ni kulilaga m'mawindo, makungulu tigacitamaga pa mlango wakwe. Yitela ya mikungusa taciyitengulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welewu ni msinda uwalitendaga kuti uli wakutamilicika, uwatiga usyene kuti, “Une apano! Pangali soni jwine iyayi!” Awulole mwele muwujonasicile sambano. Uŵele masame gakutama yinyama yakwitinji. Jwalijose jwakupita tacigambaga kulapa ni kupukunyaga mtwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
